       <div class='lh-story-block'><div class='lh-story-block__image'  data-lhi="stories[1]image" data-lhis="stories-image"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0493/2337/6806/t/14/assets/whatsapp-image-20220222-at-110542-1645528034604_1200x.jpeg?v=1645528036100" /></div><h3  data-lhi="stories[1]title" data-lh-lang data-lhis="stories-title">{{ 'iqxzrIYVsy.lh_35nryd_title' | t }}</h3><div  data-lhi="stories[1]body" data-lh-lang data-lh-live-editor data-lhis="stories-body">Happier Every Chapter is very much a family business. We are grateful to have parents who support our passion enough to help us grow the idea to what it is today. We are the creative side; writing short stories, doing school talks, helping to curate books and gifts while Mum &amp; Dad run the business side teaching us a few things along the way😊. <br><br>Support for our books, Happier Every Chapter &amp; our virtual author visits has been phenomenal. <span style="font-weight: bold;">For that, we cannot say enough thanks.<br><br></span>Please feel free to reach out with any questions or comments and we will do our best to help. Contact us on <span style="font-weight: bold;">+44 (0)7949 820 944</span> or <span style="font-weight: bold;">hello@<span class="skimlinks-unlinked">happiereverychapter.com</span></span><br><br>You can also join our Facebook community to stay in the loop by clicking below.&nbsp;<span style="font-weight: bold;">Lets create a tribe of readers!</span></div><p  data-lhi="stories[1]link" data-lh-lang data-lhi-child="a" data-lhis="stories-link">{{ 'iqxzrIYVsy.lh_35nryd_link_html' | t }}</p></div>
       
