{"locales":{"en":{"zrRXjPMteS":{"lh_a168_title":"Get to Know Us","lh_a168_subtitle":"Books are uniquely portable magic","lh_8huk_link_html":"<a href=\"#lh-about-intro\" data-ga-action=\"btn_link\" data-ga-label=\"Learn More\" data-lhlink>Learn More<\/a>"},"rzOTmkaByX":{"lh_a168_title":"The Inspiration Behind Happier Every Chapter"},"lIdgMAo6uR":{"lh_a168_kicker":"WHAT WE DO","lh_a168_title":"Our Mission: Promoting Diverse Literature for Children","lh_1cytzo_title":"Sagas of Anya by K. Mbawa","lh_1cytzo_body_html":"What would you do if you had to become a maid at thirteen working for a nasty housekeeper? After her mam dies, 12yr old Anya watches as her once loving tad turns to drink. Things hit a new low the next year and Anya is forced to travel from Victorian Cardiff to London to become a scullery maid at Tippets House, under the watchful eye and cruel hand of Mrs. Axton.\n<br><br>\nSpirited and bright, Anya makes friends and some enemies too. Will she survive and find a loving place to belong again or will this life of drudgery be forever? Anya's story will grab you and keep you until the last word.<br><br>Fans of historical fiction will not be able to put this down. If you loved Hetty Feather, you will be a huge fan of Sagas of Anya<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_1cytzo_link_html":"<a href=\"https:\/\/www.happiereverychapter.com\/products\/sagas-of-anya-paperback\" data-ga-action=\"card_1_link\" data-ga-label=\"Get the book\" data-lhlink>Get the book<\/a>","lh_1cytzp_title":"Land of the Nurogons by A. Mbawa","lh_1cytzp_body_html":"I, Hayden Smith, never considered myself to be the \u2018chosen one\u2019. I thought I was your average high school kid. But, no, of course I was completely wrong. And I have a sneaking suspicion that however much I tried to avoid my fate, I\u2019d end up in the same place, Nurogonia.\n<br><br>\nAnd now a bloke called Sosiri plans to turn the world of Nurogonia into something unimaginable. If he succeeds, we\u2019re all dead. It\u2019s my problem to prevent that. All those deaths would be on my hands. And if I fail? Oh, never mind, I won\u2019t be alive to find out.&nbsp;<br><br>Love middle-grade fantasy? Harry Potter? Percy Jackson? You'll love this! Join Hayden &amp; co on a jounrey that will not be easy to forget.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_1cytzp_link_html":"<a href=\"https:\/\/www.happiereverychapter.com\/products\/land-of-the-nurogons-paperback\" data-ga-action=\"card_2_link\" data-ga-label=\"Get the book\" data-lhlink>Get the book<\/a>","lh_1cytzq_title":"Happier Every Chapter Book Box","lh_1cytzq_body_html":"There's few things quite like a good book.&nbsp;Meet <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Happier Every Chapter<\/span>, the book box every bookworm needs. After noticing a lack of diversity in the subscription boxes we tried to get our books into, we decided to launch ours to promote reading for pleasure &amp; diversity awareness. For schools wanting to diversify their libraries, we also do book bundles too.<br><br>Our&nbsp;<b>Winning Tots<\/b> box for 0-3s is packed with fantastic books and starts children early on the reading journey.&nbsp;<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Little Literates<\/span> box for 4-7s has 1-5 inclusive books, worksheets &amp; up to 2 gifts.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Thought Leaders<\/span>&nbsp;box for 8-12s &amp; <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Book Wolves<\/span> box for 13-14s include 1-5 books, worksheets &amp; up to 2 gifts&nbsp;<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_1cytzq_link_html":"<a href=\"https:\/\/www.happiereverychapter.com\" data-ga-action=\"card_3_link\" data-ga-label=\"Get the Box\" data-lhlink>Get the Box<\/a>","lh_1cytzr_title_html":"Author Visits & Creative Writing Workshops","lh_1cytzr_body_html":"There is no-one better to inspire us than those we can relate to. <br><br>Children can't be what they can't see and that is the power of working with us to inspire children in families, schools and other learning institutions.<br><br>If you are a school or academy looking for authors to visit or conduct a creative writing workshop to inspire your pupils to develop the will and skill to read and write for pleasure, we would be more than happy to help.<br><br>Head to our Author Visits page to find out more.<br><br>Make a <a href=\"https:\/\/happiereverychapter.com\/pages\/author-visits\" target=\"_self\">booking enquiry<\/a>, email us at hello@<span class=\"skimlinks-unlinked\">happiereverychapter.com<\/span> or call +44 (0) 7949 820 944 for more information<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_1cytzr_link_html":"<a href=\"https:\/\/happiereverychapter.com\/pages\/author-visits\" data-ga-action=\"card_4_link\" data-ga-label=\"Learn More\" data-lhlink>Learn More<\/a>"},"iqxzrIYVsy":{"lh_a168_title":"THE JOURNEY. THE TEAM. THE COMMUNITY","lh_35nryc_title":"THE JOURNEY","lh_35nryc_body_html":"Did you know that:<br>\ud83d\udcda1 in 5 children enter secondary school without being able to read properly?&nbsp;<br>\ud83d\udcda9 million adults in the UK are functionally illiterate?<br>\ud83d\udcdaOnly 8% of children's books published in 2020 had an ethnic minority main character?<br><br>From March 2019 when the book reviews started to April 2020 when our books were published up until now, there's been a steady growth in our community telling of the need for better literacy outcomes by getting more children to read for pleasure.&nbsp;<br><br>As well as the boxes, we carry out book reviews on Facebook and YouTube &amp; where possible the <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">author(s) <\/span>whose books have been featured in one of our&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">monthly boxes will be invited for a <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=OBN9bnSx6pE\" style=\"color: rgb(22, 41, 80); font-weight: bold;\">Live Author Interview<\/a>&nbsp;to chat about their book.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_35nryc_link_html":"<a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/channel\/UC1-zobH5aogUrGF02gIW3lw\" data-ga-action=\"journey_link\" data-ga-label=\"Watch Us On YouTube\" data-lhlink>Watch Us On YouTube<\/a>","lh_35nryd_title":"THE TEAM. THE COMMUNITY","lh_35nryd_link_html":"<a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/257245542378556?_kx=P215Sgufin03SYVG4-vKW0SRyTXkzjBqb2zgXiLtu-I%3D.RmhJAG\" data-ga-action=\"team_link\" data-ga-label=\"Join Our Facebook Group\" data-lhlink>Join Our Facebook Group<\/a>"},"0lYeXWsS7d":{"lh_a168_title":"HIGHLIGHTS","lh_ku5mxb_title":"BBC LOOK EAST TV","lh_ku5mxb_link_html":"<a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=PuEJW6mL-m8\" data-ga-action=\"bbc_link\" data-ga-label=\"Catch Us On BBC\" data-lhlink>Catch Us On BBC<\/a>","lh_ku5mxa_title_html":"Channel 4 Steph's Packed Lunch Small Business Market","lh_ku5mxa_body_html":"We couldn't have been more thrilled to have been invited to appear on Channel 4's Steph's Packed Lunch Small Business Market. To top it all off, we got to meet people like Alan Johnson and Oti Mabuse. You can read more the day in this <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mbawabooks.co.uk\/blogs\/news\/our-feature-on-channel-4s-stephs-packed-lunch\" target=\"_self\" style=\"color: rgb(22, 41, 80);\">blog post<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=cxmNBdAGpa0\" target=\"_self\" style=\"color: rgb(22, 41, 80);\">watch the vlog <\/a>we did for the event.<br><br>It was amazing to showcase, Happier Every Chapter, our small business alongside other kidpreneurs who had been invited to the show.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mxa_link_html":"<a href=\"https:\/\/youtu.be\/oTO8InO6dU8\" data-ga-action=\"channel4_link\" data-ga-label=\"Watch the Video\" data-lhlink>Watch the Video<\/a>","lh_ku5mx9_title":"Disney Ultimate Princess Time to Shine In Association with The Female Lead","lh_ku5mx9_body_html":"We\u2019re over the moon to have worked on the Disney Family UK campaign, \u2018<a href=\"https:\/\/press.disney.co.uk\/news\/disney-princess-and-the-female-lead-team-up-to-boost-confidence-in-kids\" target=\"_self\">Disney Ultimate Princess Celebration: Time to Shine<\/a>\u2019, in association with The Female Lead &amp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.mirror.co.uk\/lifestyle\/family\/top-female-role-models-children-27870805\" target=\"_self\">Leah Williamson<\/a>, the Euro Winning Lioness Captain. The campaign hopes to boost confidence of 3-6 year olds starting school this year. On 30th August, we were inducted into The Female Lead as the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.society.thefemalelead.com\/disney\" target=\"_self\">First Ever Young Female Leads<\/a> adding to its line-up of awe-inspiring females. We\u2019ve hosted and narrated the Princess Pep Talks which you can view <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_ukkiOOKbe4\" target=\"_self\">here<\/a>!&nbsp;<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx9_link_html":"<a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/Ch4Zk64ulQ-\/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\" data-ga-action=\"disney_link\" data-ga-label=\"Watch the Video\" data-lhlink>Watch the Video<\/a>","lh_ku5mx8_title":"BBC 500 Words Writing Competition Relaunch","lh_ku5mx8_body_html":"In a very full circle turn of events, we were filmed in July for the relaunch of the BBC 500 Words Writing Competition!<br><br>With this being how the story started for us, it was such an honour to share where our journey has taken us so far from the 2019 when we first entered the competition.&nbsp;<br><br>Click <a href=\"https:\/\/youtu.be\/tihQb57-u2s\" target=\"_self\">here <\/a>to watch the clip aired on BBC Look East TV&nbsp; .<br>Grateful to BBC Teach for sharing our story and letting us inspire our peers to fall in love with reading and writing.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx8_link_html":"<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bbc.co.uk\/teach\/500-words\/sisters\/znm2nk7\" data-ga-action=\"bbc500_link\" data-ga-label=\"Watch the Video\" data-lhlink>Watch the Video<\/a>"},"V7xkyeI5Bg":{"lh_a168_title_html":"SEE WHAT PEOPLE ARE SAYING ABOUT OUR BOXES & BOOK REVIEWS","lh_ku5mxb_title":"Absolutely amazing!!!","lh_ku5mxb_body_html":"The idea of having a special little box arrive each month with amazing books to read and goodies, is an inspirational idea! My son has absolutely loved his first box and has already read the first novel. It is such a lovely way to encourage our youngsters to read!<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mxb_author":"Vicky A.","lh_ku5mxa_title":"Amazing Christmas Present","lh_ku5mxa_body_html":"My daughter\u2019s favourite Christmas present this year. It is lovely to get a parcel in the post and my little bookworm loves discovering new authors. The little extras are also lovely.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mxa_author":"Kathleen B.","lh_ku5mx9_title_html":"Empowering & inspiring!","lh_ku5mx9_body_html":"Fantastic recommendations, empowering and inspiring girls.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx9_author":"Tamsin W.","lh_ku5mx8_title":"A joy to watch","lh_ku5mx8_body_html":"These young ladies are a joy to listen to! They do a great job with their reviews and have an obvious passion for books! I recommend them highly!<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx8_author":"Jared W.","lh_ku5mx7_title_html":"Interesting, funny & detailed","lh_ku5mx7_body_html":"These young ladies are amazing. Such a joy to watch and listen to. Interesting, funny and detailed. Their reviews are clear, lovely and honest.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx7_author":"Vese A.","lh_ku5mx6_title":"Bubble of joy and positivity","lh_ku5mx6_body_html":"What a bubble of joy and positivity these two reviewers are. They review a terrific variety of books, provide detailed reviews and encourage kids and adults alike to read widely.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx6_author":"Elena P.","lh_ku5mx5_title":"Relatable Reviews kids will love","lh_ku5mx5_body_html":"The girls read books live on their site and discuss the lessons found within each storyline. They are relatable with other children and share their viewpoints on each book.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx5_author":"Cindy S.","lh_ku5mx4_title":"Amazing, Fantastic and Exciting.","lh_ku5mx4_body_html":"My first parcel was exciting because I discovered new books, short stories written by the Mbawa book reviewers, a motivational notebook, hot chocolate and other lovely items.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ku5mx4_author":"Lani-Elsa I."},"h82DotuJg9":{"lh_ku5mxb_caption_html":"New Theme & New Books Every Month","lh_ku5mxa_caption_html":"Bestselling diverse & inclusive books and short stories plus treats","lh_ku5mx9_caption_html":"Engaging & inspiring books from Happier Every Chapter"},"7kPTXZuKO6":{"lh_a168_title":"AS SEEN IN"}}},"name":"Test"}
